    "num": "3",
    "date_str": "2016-10-11",
    "description": "Draft Concept Paper and Framework pertaining to the establishment of \u201cGrama Rajya\u201d Units",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=7110",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2016-10-11",
    "decision_details_body": "- A proposal to establish 2,500 \u201cGrama Rajya\u201d units throughout the Island, in order to ensure the active participation of the general public in the development process, was included in the \u201cFive Point Plan\u201d policy statement presented in the General Election 2015.  Accordingly, the draft concept paper and framework prepared by the Committee comprising of public officers, university scholars, retired public officers and representatives from non-Government sectors, appointed to prepare a draft concept paper for the establishment of \u201cGrama Rajaya\u201d units, and submitted to the Cabinet by Hon. Ranil Wickremasinghe, the Prime Minister, was referred to the Parliamentary Sectoral Oversight Committee on Internal Administration and Public Management for further discussion, as decided by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
