    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2015-03-18",
    "decision_details_body": "- The objective of this programme is to develop a framework needed to extend  cooperation in the field of sport research, development and excellence between the two countries based on the mutual performance and aspirations. In this regard, a greater focus will be made on the following aspects: \r\n*\tExchange of teams of Boxing, Golf, Karate, Taekwondo, Table Tennis, Volley Ball,  Baseball, Hockey, Squash and Cricket;\r\n*\tExchange of sports training programmes and officials; \r\n*\tExchange of equipment required for development of sports related programmes; \r\n\t\r\n\tAccordingly, the proposal made by Hon. Navin Dissanayake, Minister of Tourism and Sports, to enter into the above Memorandum of Understanding, was approved by the Cabinet."
