    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2015-02-18",
    "decision_details_body": "- having taking into consideration that the consumers do not get the benefit of the price reduction of commodities announced in the interim budget, the joint proposal submitted by Hon. Gamini Jayawickrema Perera, Minister of Food Security; and Hon. Karu Jayasuriya, Public Administration, Provincial Councils, Local Government and Democratic Governance to direct the Consumer Affairs Authority to publish a notification in the Government Gazette indicating the prices of items reduced, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_cabinet_decisions",
    "doc_id": "2015-02-18-008-en",
    "num": "8",
    "date_str": "2015-02-18",
    "description": "Establishment of Cabinet Sub?Committees",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=5956",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2015-02-18",
    "decision_details_body": "- the proposal made by Hon. Ranil Wickremasinghe, the Prime Minister for the establishment of five Cabinet Sub?Committees to make an in-depth study of the issues relating to the respective subject fields and make appropriate recommendations in order to facilitate the decision making process of the Cabinet, was approved by the Cabinet. \r\n\r\n\t(a)\tCabinet Sub?Committee on National Policy\r\n\t(b)\tCabinet Sub?Committee on Economic Affairs\r\n\t(c)\tCabinet Sub?Committee on Establishment Matters\r\n\t(d)\tCabinet Sub?Committee on Legislation\r\n\t(e)\tCabinet Sub?Committee on Procurement Matters\r\n\r\n\tThe Cabinet is vested with the responsibility of appointing Heads of Departments in terms of Article 55(2) of the Constitution. Therefore, to facilitate the appointment of more suitable persons to such posts, the responsibility of making recommendations for same is vested in the Cabinet Sub?Committee on Establishment Matters. The Cabinet also decided that the Secretary to the Cabinet should report to the Cabinet Sub?Committee on Establishment Matters in consultation with the Public Service Commission and the relevant administrative authority, in this connection."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_cabinet_decisions",
    "doc_id": "2015-02-18-007-en",
    "num": "7",
    "date_str": "2015-02-18",
    "description": "Allocation of Provision Required for the Payment of Salaries of the Employees and Incurring other Expenses of Kantale Sugar Company Ltd",
