    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2014-09-30",
    "decision_details_body": "- the proposal made by Hon. Patali Champika Ranawaka, Minister of Technology and Research, to sign the above Memorandum of Understanding between the two countries, with the objective of enhancing cooperation between the two Institutions in relation to the peaceful applications of Atomic Energy, was approved by the Cabinet."
