    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2013-08-29",
    "decision_details_body": "- the proposed Project is to be implemented in Galle and Kandy as the initial phase of the project.\u00a0 The assistance of the World Bank will be received for this urban development programme of the Government, to plan, design and develop selected cities and its surrounding areas to facilitate a guided economic transformation of such cities into one of the major regional economic centres for growth and employment generation.\u00a0 The project is to be commenced in 2013 and completed within a period of three (03) years at a cost of US $200 million.\u00a0 Some of the salient features of the project are as follows:*\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0improved urban infrastructure and services at the city centre and peripheral local authority areas of Greater Kandy and Galle cities.*\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0improved traffic and transport arrangements in both cities.*\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0improved urban road network to ease the traffic flow in both cities.*\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0benefits to the urban community by improving drainage facilities and solid waste management systems. Cabinet granted approval to proceed with the project submitted by H.E. the President,\u00a0 in his capacity as the Minister of Defence and Urban Development."
