    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-09-21",
    "decision_details_body": "- the proposal made by H.E. the President to implement a series of development projects and programmes in the Anuradhapura District in connection with the Deyata Kirula 2012, was approved by the Cabinet.  Some of the development activities to be undertaken are - \r\n\r\n*\tdevelopment of Highways, Provincial Roads and Road System of rural areas;\r\n*\trehabilitation of irrigation canals and tanks;\r\n*\timplementation of community based projects in 702 villages in the Anuradhapura District;\r\n\t\t*\tprovision of sanitary facilities for schools;\r\n\t\t*\tdevelopment of 50 pre-schools;\r\n\t\t*\tconstruction of Rain Water Harvesting Tanks;\r\n\t\t*\testablishment of 06 dairy villages;\r\n\t\t*\tdevelopment of the University of Rajarata;\r\n\t\t*\trehabilitation of paddy storages and grinding mills; and\r\n*\trehabilitation of Temples, Churches, Mosques and Hindu Temples in remote areas in the District."
