    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-08-24",
    "decision_details_body": "- Cabinet noted the progress of the programme of purchasing paddy in the Yala Season 2011, presented by Hon. Jonston Fernando, Minister of Co-operatives and Internal Trade, giving the following details totaling to 5889 MT. as at 23.08.2011: \r\n\r\n\t\t*\tPolonnaruwa Region\t-\t\t1181 MT\r\n\t\t*\tNorth Western Region\t-\t\t206   MT\r\n\t\t*\tAmpara Region\t\t-\t\t 971  MT\r\n\t\t*\tAnuradhapura Region\t-\t\t 436  MT\r\n\t\t*\tSouthern Region\t\t-\t\t 3009 MT\r\n\t\t*\tNorthern Region\t\t-\t\t     78 MT\r\n\r\n\tThe Paddy Marketing Board expects to purchase 75,000 MT. of paddy during the 2011 Yala Season."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_cabinet_decisions",
    "doc_id": "2011-08-24-013-en",
    "num": "13",
    "date_str": "2011-08-24",
    "description": "International Conference on the Theme \"Community and Water Services - Challenges for Sustainability\"",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=4169",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-08-24",
    "decision_details_body": "- the Community Water Supply Project has been designed to motivate and encourage rural communities to be self-reliant in their water supply and sanitation needs.   This project has been implemented in stages in various parts of the country with the direct participation of the community.  There are nearly 3500 community based organizations formed under this project, covering of approximately 600,000  families.  The proposal made by Hon. Dinesh Gunawardena, Minister of Water Supply and Drainage to hold an International Conference on the above Theme from 29th to 30th September 2011 in Kandy, with the entire cost being borne by foreign/local organizations who are directly involved in water supply and sanitation sector activities, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
