    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-08-24",
    "decision_details_body": "- the proposal made \tby Hon. W.D.J. Seneviratne, Minister of Public Administration and Home Affairs for \tthe construction of  new buildings  for the following Divisional Secretariats was \tapproved by the Cabinet.  Initial expenses of these buildings are to be borne with funds \tprovided in 2011 and the balance to be provided by the General Treasury from 2012 \tonwards: \r\n\r\n\t\t*\tNuwaragam Palatha East Divisional Secretariat \r\n\t\t*\tNochchiyagama Divisional Secretariat\r\n\t\t*\tRajanganaya Divisional Secretariat\r\n\t\t*\tLahugala Divisional Secretariat\r\n\t\t*\tPadiyathalawa Divisional Secretariat\r\n\t\t*\tNinthavur Divisional Secretariat\t\t\r\n\t\t*\tHorana Divisional Secretariat\r\n\t\t\r\n\tA model type plan for the construction of buildings for Divisional Secretariats is to be prepared by the Ministry of Public Administration and Home Affairs, with the assistance of the University of Moratuwa, focusing on energy saving, materials to be used for construction etc., which could be used for future constructions."
  },
  {
