    "num": "7",
    "date_str": "2011-08-24",
    "description": "Construction of Courts Complex at Homagama",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=4163",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-08-24",
    "decision_details_body": "- the proposal made by Hon. Rauff Hakeem, Minister of Justice, to construct a four storied building to accommodate two Magistrate Courts, a District Court, a High Court and a Commercial High Court at Homagama at a cost of Rs.464.4 million with funds to be provided from 2011 to 2013, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
  {
