    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-06-22",
    "decision_details_body": "Corporation - this toll expressway from Kottawa to Godagama \t(Matara) is 126 Km. in length and the road from Kottawa to Pinnaduwa is \texpected to commence operation in July 2011. Rest areas along this route are \tto be constructed on both sides of the expressway, 44 Km. from Kottawa, \tnear Welipenna interchange, on state land. Restaurants and Shops will be \tconstructed in the Rest Areas and other utilities such as water, telephone, \ttoilet facilities, parking areas etc. will be provided.  The proposal made by \tH.E. the President to handover the development, operation and maintenance \tof the Rest Areas to the Sri Lanka Insurance Corporation was approved by \tthe Cabinet."
